        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9102/30, Vintage Collection Daphne Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Vintage Collection Daphne Cabinet Knob is available in 3 rustic looking finishes. The weathered appearance makes the Daphne Vintage Finish Cabinet Knob great for historic homes. The Omnia 9102 Cabinet Knob comes packaged with the mounting screw. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available the <a href=\"/products/daphne-cabinet-knob-omnia-9102-30\"><b>Omnia 9200 Daphne Cabinet Knob</b></a> in other finishes and other <a href=\"/collections/omnia-cabinet-hardware\"><b>Omnia Vintage Collection Cabinet Knobs</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 9102 Daphne Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
